docs {
Toggle upvote/downvote pada target polymorphic (08-api-upvote-downvote.md).
Login wajib (semua role, termasuk contributor). Client baru: target_type
meaning. Client lama (≤ v0.4.0) boleh kirim word - API remap ke makna
(52-api-mobile-v040-vote-compat); response tetap target_type meaning.

Semantik TOGGLE: vote searah kedua kali = batal (my_vote null); vote beda
arah = ganti. Response selalu membawa state final - jalankan request ini
dua kali untuk melihat my_vote 1 → null.

200 sukses (upvote pertama):

    {
      "success": true,
      "data": {
        "target_type": "meaning",
        "target_id": "01J...",
        "my_vote": 1,
        "upvotes": 1,
        "downvotes": 0
      }
    }

404 target tidak dikenal / sudah di-soft-delete:

    { "success": false, "error_code": "VOTE_TARGET_NOT_FOUND", "message": "Target vote tidak ditemukan atau sudah dihapus", "details": null }

400 target_type di luar enum (word|meaning|example|…|pantun_reply)
401 tanpa token; 429 lebih dari 60 toggle/menit per user.

TANPA audit trail per vote (keputusan 08: volume tinggi, bukan aksi admin).
}

meta {
  name: Toggle Vote
  seq: 1
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/votes
  body: json
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{contributor_access_token}}
}

body:json {
  {
    "target_type": "meaning",
    "target_id": "{{meaning_id}}",
    "value": 1
  }
}

tests {
  test("200 + state final vote (my_vote/upvotes/downvotes)", () => {
    expect(res.status).to.equal(200);
    expect(res.body.success).to.equal(true);
    expect(res.body.data.target_type).to.equal("meaning");
    expect(res.body.data.target_id).to.equal(vars.meaning_id);
    // Jalankan dua kali: my_vote 1 lalu null (toggle). Angka harus konsisten:
    expect(res.body.data.upvotes + res.body.data.downvotes).to.be.at.least(0);
  });
}
